@startuml Pickup
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title Pickup (HeartPickup, SeedPickup)
rectangle c [
|= Responsibilities |= Collaborators |
| Sit at a drop location | EnemyManager |
| Detect the player touching it | Player |
| Apply its effect via collect() | Player, SeedWeapon |
| Remove itself once collected | Node |
]
@enduml
